monopoly-desc-roll = Roll two dice and move. Doubles grant another roll unless they are used to leave jail; three consecutive doubles send you to jail.
monopoly-desc-buy = Buy the unowned property where you landed for its printed price.
monopoly-desc-decline-property = Decline this purchase. The Bank must immediately auction the property to every player, including you.
monopoly-desc-raise-cash = Sells legal development levels first, then mortgages eligible properties, stopping as soon as cash covers the debt. Use Manage properties if you want to choose the assets yourself.
monopoly-desc-bankruptcy = Ends your game and transfers your remaining assets to the creditor or the Bank. This is available only when all cash and liquid assets still cannot cover the debt.
monopoly-desc-choose-build-property = Opens a list of properties where you can legally afford the next development level.
monopoly-desc-choose-sell-property = Opens a list of development levels that can be sold while keeping each color group even.
monopoly-desc-choose-mortgage-property = Opens a list of properties that can be mortgaged. A color group must have no development before one of its properties can be mortgaged.
monopoly-desc-choose-unmortgage-property = Opens a list of mortgaged properties you can currently afford to unmortgage.
monopoly-desc-build = Buys the next development level on this property. Development must stay even across its color group.
monopoly-desc-sell-building = Sells one development level to the Bank for half its purchase cost. Sales must stay even across the color group.
monopoly-desc-sell-group-buildings = Sells every development level in this color group, following the even-selling rule.
monopoly-desc-mortgage = Receives the mortgage value now. The property stays yours but cannot collect rent while mortgaged.
monopoly-desc-unmortgage = Pays the mortgage value plus interest so the property can collect rent again.
monopoly-prompt-bid = Enter your bid as a whole number.
monopoly-prompt-portfolio-player = Choose a player to view their properties.
monopoly-prompt-choose-build-property = Choose a property that can receive its next development level now.
monopoly-prompt-choose-sell-property = Choose a development level that can be sold now.
monopoly-prompt-choose-mortgage-property = Choose a property that can be mortgaged now.
monopoly-prompt-choose-unmortgage-property = Choose a mortgaged property you can afford to unmortgage now.
monopoly-prompt-choose-managed-property = Choose one of your properties to inspect or manage.
monopoly-prompt-back-to-property-list = Choose another property, or cancel to keep viewing this one.
monopoly-prompt-trade-player = Choose the player you want to trade with.
monopoly-prompt-offer-property = Choose a property to add to or remove from your offer.
monopoly-prompt-request-property = Choose a property to add to or remove from your request.
